<title>USA: Stant names new chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Stant names new chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Ind. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stant Corp said Wednesday it named Thomas Erwin, a former Brunswick Corp executive, to the post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Stant's former chief financial officer, Thomas Schmitt, left the company on Monday to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Stant manufactures windshield wiper systems and other automotive products.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 1/2 Wednesday at 14.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
